{"2337180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I NEED SPACE", "steam_appid": 2337180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/989721468ab8d52868e957fe5a6779b6.poster.avif?t=1771676545\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/989721468ab8d52868e957fe5a6779b6.webm?t=1771676545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/989721468ab8d52868e957fe5a6779b6.mp4?t=1771676545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>I NEED SPACE</strong></i> is an artfully hand-crafted <i><strong>space adventure</strong></i> game that features a wholesome twist of the <i><strong>sci-fi fantasy</strong></i> genre. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/7b54be093edde5be5e40f1fc1c2d5a3f.avif?t=1771676545\" width=617 height=135 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/c264b9b09ad77b620e31ec1e86f4832f.poster.avif?t=1771676545\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/c264b9b09ad77b620e31ec1e86f4832f.webm?t=1771676545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/c264b9b09ad77b620e31ec1e86f4832f.mp4?t=1771676545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >w