 width=617 height=213 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/e46ef359b15b2342634df2ffc0135d05.poster.avif?t=1771676545\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/e46ef359b15b2342634df2ffc0135d05.webm?t=1771676545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/e46ef359b15b2342634df2ffc0135d05.mp4?t=1771676545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/dcfc38e5b9486742e20fee2baf642c2b.avif?t=1771676545\" width=617 height=213 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/aad686e6b60ed10b8b5e83a41edaf629.poster.avif?t=1771676545\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/aad686e6b60ed10b8b5e83a41edaf629.webm?t=1771676545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/aad686e6b60ed10b8b5e83a41edaf629.mp4?t=1771676545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/e6320f051d348ed016f91b2dcd519c7b.avif?t=1771676545\" width=617 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>I NEED SPACE</strong></i> is a 2D video game artfully designed to be a reflection of <i><strong>critical </strong></i>environmental issues such as; <i><strong>climate change, coastal fracking, deforestation, waste management challenges</strong></i> - all woven into the fabric of a cautionary tale, with the ultimate aspiration of sharing deeper <i><strong>awareness</strong></i> regarding the issues, to encourage players into <i><strong>adopting</strong></i>  eco-friendly lifestyles, and <i><strong>participating</strong></i> in environmental initiatives in real life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is of the utmost importance to note that though the game story is fantastical in nature - our studio ensure credibility and prevent the spread of misleading information by consistently collaborating with local <i><strong>NGOs</strong></i> and subject-matter specialists. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Activation:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10% of launch sales will go towards environmental / animal welfare actions.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% of sales during World Ocean Day month (June) goes towards ocean related collaborations.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100% of sales made from Animal/ Cats related events will go towards designated animal shelters.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/2cdfeb00bbf5ab5e1c327697f538e6a1.avif?t=1771676545\" width=617 height=135 /></span>Follow our social media and be the first to know about release dates, sneak peeks, and exclusive offers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also join us on discord and be an Early Explorer to participate in playtests, get exclusive stickers, and get to know the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐️INSTAGRAM | @i_need_space__game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐️TWITTER | @INeedSpace_game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/extras/e6320f051d348ed016f91b2dcd519c7b.avif?t=1771676545\" width=617 height=135 /></span></p>", "short_description": "The story of a Space Traveler and a Cosmic Cat, on their journey across the sea of stars to find their home and rekindle a dying universe from a mysterious Galactical Pandemic.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/header.jpg?t=1771676545", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771676545", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337180/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771676545", "website": "https://www.khayalanarts.com/projects/ineedspace", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 780<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p, 16:9 recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p, 16:9 recommended</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "I NE